# Read by `wrangler dev` only, over [vars] in wrangler.toml; never deployed.
# A local Worker serves its files itself: the bucket domains name the
# deployed buckets, and a file uploaded here is not there. The suite pins
# the same in vitest.config.ts.
FILES_URL=""
# And takes them in itself, through its own PUT door: with no bucket
# named, it never signs an upload address, even if R2 keys were put
# here, so a local Worker cannot write to production's bucket (whose
# CORS rule does not admit a localhost origin either).
FILES_BUCKET=""
